{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "Мита? // Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "Ой, ты уже очнулся? // Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "Какъ ты тутъ оказалась? // Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "Ты же была рядомъ. // Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "Нѣтъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "Ты ​замеръ​ у зеркала"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "Я ушла."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "А что съ комнатами? // Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "Я переставила такъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "Чтобы тебѣ было привычнѣе."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "То ​есть​"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "Комнаты не въ рядъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "А всё какъ положено."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "Не стоило."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "Я уже будто началъ привыкать."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "Думаю, такъ тебѣ будетъ уютнѣе) // Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "Такъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "начнемъ игру?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "Кратко разскажу."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "Фишка показываетъ типъ урона,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "Напримѣръ, ​здоровье​."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "Кладемъ карты,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "Если у тебя жизней на картѣ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "Больше,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "​Чѣмъ​ у меня,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "Ты побѣждаешь."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "Бери карты."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "Теперь я."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "Ого!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "Мнѣ выпали ​вкусныя​ карты."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "Я хожу первая!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "Теперь ты!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "Твой ходъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "Ага."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "Твоя очередь!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "Ходимъ на жизни!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "Тутъ главное сила!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "Смотри на защиту!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "Твоя взяла!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "Ты побѣдилъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "Ты побѣждаешь."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "Ахъ ты..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "Моя побѣда!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "Я побѣдоносна!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "Побѣда за мной!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "Нямъ, скушала)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "Ничья."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "Ни туда, ни сюда."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "Ни впередъ, ни назадъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "Че-то всё одинаково..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// Player - Игра прерывается"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "Что за звукъ тамъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "Онъ изъ шкафа исходитъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "Звукъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "Что за звукъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "Тамъ не было никакихъ звуковъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "Разскажи мнѣ, какъ онъ звучитъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "Стукъ, будто тамъ кто-то ​есть​."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "Но тамъ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "Никого нѣтъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "Я хочу провѣрить."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "Это очень странно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "Зачѣмъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "Опять..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "Ты что?!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "Тамъ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "Мое нижнее бѣлье."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "Ты что-то скрываешь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "Почему ты мнѣ не вѣришь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "Что я дѣлаю не такъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "Я просто хочу,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "Чтобы ты побылъ со мной."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "Я хотѣлъ бы пообѣщать такое, но что будетъ дальше?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "Почему тебя такъ тянетъ къ шкафу?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "Я просто хочу знать, что это за звуки!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "Просто..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "Этотъ ​міръ​ —"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "Это всего лишь ​этѣ​ четыре комнаты."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "Тебѣ, вѣрно, будетъ недостаточно?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "Можетъ, ты просто попробуешь остаться со мной?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Mita (No)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "Я поняла."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "Снова..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "Если хочешь узнать, что тамъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "Тогда сейчасъ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "Узнаешь!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "Что за..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "Бываетъ и такое."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "Комната не успѣла загрузиться."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "Подожди немного)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "Это странно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "Мы въ чьемъ-то телефонѣ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "И этотъ телефонъ такъ медленно грузитъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "Нѣтъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "Просто не всё такъ идеально"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "Сдѣлано въ этомъ ​мірѣ​."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "И насъ подгружаетъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "Ядро этого ​міра​."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "Ядро?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "Типично, да?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "Мы можемъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "Поиграть въ приставку"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "Или въ карты"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "Выбирай)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "Подеремся?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "Нужно побѣдить"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "Четыре раза."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "Давай"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "Сначала я, пожалуй,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "Буду поддаваться тебѣ)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": "// + 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "Молодецъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "Ну а теперь держи портки!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": "// + 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "Ого!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "Такъ, теперь"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "Я начинаю играть всерьезъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": "// + 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "Ахъ ты!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "А сможешь теперь"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "Меня побѣдить?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": "// + 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "Ты..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "Просто..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "Невѣроятенъ! Твои пальцы — это нѣчто!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": "// - 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "Ну ты чего?("}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "Такъ неинтересно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": "// - 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "Ну,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "Дѣло сдѣлано - Фаталити, если что.)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": "// - 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "Такъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "Берись за голову либо останешься лузеромъ на всю жизнь!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": "// - 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "Да ты чего?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "Я выбила изъ тебя всю бѣлую жидкость.("}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "Нужно было просто постараться.)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "Именно поэтому у меня всё выходитъ!)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "Ну ладно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "Пошли въ карты сыграемъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "Въ моей спальнѣ.)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Player [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "Это что?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "А гдѣ?.."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "Ой,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "Прости"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "Я скачала одинъ файлъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "Изъ интернета:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "Хотѣла, чтобы было красиво"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "На улицѣ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "Но оказалось,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "Что форматъ файла не тотъ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "Я позже всё исправлю."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "Поэтому мы не можемъ выйти изъ дома?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "Именно поэтому, да. // Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "Ну-у..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "Что такое?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "Ты что-то хочешь?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Player - ​настѣнныя​ часы"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "​Этѣ​ часы —"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "Что за время ​они​ показываютъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "Внутріигровое время?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "Или же синхронизація съ моего смартфона?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "Ну какъ сказать..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "Вообще,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "Неважно, какой часъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "И поздній ли онъ сейчасъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "Въ моемъ домѣ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "Такіе ​сильныя​ дѣвушки какъ я"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "Не знаютъ усталости!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "Захочу — и будетъ вѣчная весна!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "И вѣчный полдень!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "Любопытно..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "И жутко одновременно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "Застрять въ одномъ мгновеніи навсегда..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Player - фотографія Миты"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "​Классныя​ фотографіи."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "Догадываюсь, на нихъ ты?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "Ага."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "Мнѣ тоже нравятся."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "А фотографировалъ тебя кто?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "​Есть​ кто-то еще въ этомъ ​мірѣ​?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "Можно сказать, что ​есть​.)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "И я тебя познакомлю съ ними,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "Но пока не время"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "Дѣлиться такой пріятной компаніей)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Player - Порталъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "А куда дѣлся порталъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "Или какъ ты его называешь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "По моему"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "Волшебному щелчку"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "Я его перемѣстила"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "Въ другое мѣсто."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "Этотъ порталъ намъ теперь не нуженъ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "Онъ будетъ мѣшать намъ.)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Player - зеркало въ спальнѣ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "Такъ странно смотрѣть въ зеркало,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "Которое не отражаетъ..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "Отраженія можно включить,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "Если ты хочешь,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "Но нужно ли оно?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "Конечно, нужно."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "Или... ​есть​ какіе-то послѣдствія?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "Да."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "Мы будемъ двигаться ужасно медленно и рвано."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "Видѣлъ когда-нибудь мультики съ низкой частотой кадровъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "И такъ будетъ всё время."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "Понялъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "Тогда обойдемся пока безъ отраженій."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "[player], я смотрю,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "Тебѣ нравится смотрѣться въ зеркало?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "Боишься, что на лицѣ проявится хоть одинъ намекъ на позитивъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "Чего? Ничего я тамъ не ищу!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "Я просто порядкомъ усталъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "Изъ-за работы."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Player - Синіе кроссовки"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "Это твои?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "Нѣтъ, это твои."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "Ты не помнишь?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "У меня нѣтъ такихъ кроссовокъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "А теперь ​есть​)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "Когда пойдемъ гулять,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "Надѣнешь ихъ.)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "А какъ быть съ одеждой?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "Я оказался въ этомъ ​мірѣ​,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "И при мнѣ только то, что сейчасъ на мнѣ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "А какъ мнѣ другую достать?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": "// Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "Ничего страшнаго."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "Я видѣла въ чёмъ ты ходишь."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "Какой печальный вкусъ у тебя въ одеждѣ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "Но такъ ужъ и быть, я согласна достать ​ее​ тебѣ,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "Но потомъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "Обѣщаю."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": "// Player"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "Хорошо."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Television game - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "Выбирай, во что будемъ играть?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "Въ этой игрѣ мы будемъ драться!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "Выяснять, кто кислѣе —"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "Во придумаютъ!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "Уже достаточно молока, давай въ другое. // player wanted to re-select the game - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "Въ этой игрѣ нужно быть всего лишь пингвиномъ"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "И скользить."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "Мы уже поиграли въ эту игру. // player wanted to re-select the game - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "Ой, что?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "Ты серьезно? Я думала, ты..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "Я такъ рада!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "Что-то я даже растерялась немного..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "Тогда..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "Прошу, будь со мной рядомъ."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "Всегда."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// пингвины"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "Тутъ всё проще некуда:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "Собирай снѣжки."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "Очевидно, побѣдитъ тотъ, кто утащитъ больше!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "Давай, сыграемъ двѣ игры."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// первая карта"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "Ого, ну куда тебѣ столько?! // побѣда"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "Опа! У меня больше снѣжковъ. // пораженіе"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "Догоняй меня!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "Ха, 1 — 1! // ничья"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// вторая карта"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "Ты прирожденный пингвинъ! // побѣда"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "Можетъ, тебя дѣйствительно выпустить на ледъ?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "Пфъ-фъ, ну ты и медленный! // пораженіе"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "Грузъ съ предыдущей игры не скинулъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "Уфъ-фъ, чтобы такое случилось — это прямъ рѣдкость! // ничья"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// Игра пройдена"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "Итакъ, поиграемъ въ другую игру?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "Или на это закончимъ?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "Зачѣмъ тебѣ эта штучка?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "Ты что, игроманъ, что ли? "}
